WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:07.980
<i>Once upon a time, monsters ran rampant 
on the western continent.</i>

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.990
<i>In their fear, 
humans built tall castle walls,</i>

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.800
<i>dug deep moats,</i>

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.420
<i>trained their warriors,</i>

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.160
<i>and united.</i>

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:20.750
<i>But...</i>

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>the monsters were great and terrible indeed.</i>

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:26.750
<i>The humans could make no progress against them.</i>

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:29.880
<i>Until one day,</i>

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:31.740
<i>a traveler arrived.</i>

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:35.130
Comin' in.

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:44.890
I see her! This way!

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.170
This again?!

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:49.900
Wait up!

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:50.900
No!

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:52.720
You must return to the palace!

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:58.190
I want to see the outside world!

00:00:58.190 --> 00:00:59.650
I want to go on a journey!

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:02.910
Princess's orders: Leave me alone!

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:05.410
Princess?

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:07.170
Excuse me! You there!

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:10.170
You mean me? What can I do?

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:16.470
Princess's orders: Help me!

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:17.980
Princess?

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:20.080
I'm being pursued by terrible villains!

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:20.970
Hide me!

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:22.300
Okay...

00:02:55.040 --> 00:03:00.480
The Princess and the Peach

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:58.320
Hey! Excuse me, miss!

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:00.480
Me?

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.070
Yes...

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:02.820
Eh?

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:04.840
I don't think I've seen you around.

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:06.240
Are you a traveler?

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:06.940
Yes.

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:11.840
A girl, traveling alone?

00:03:14.550 --> 00:03:16.470
It's none of my business, of course,

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:20.920
but there are monsters and creatures 
known as ogres in the outside world.

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:22.340
I hope you'll be careful.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:25.350
I see. I appreciate it.

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:29.350
By the way, 
did you see a girl pass this way?

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:32.230
As a matter of fact,

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:35.380
I did see a girl run off that way.

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:36.730
Did you?!

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:38.680
Thank you, kind traveler!

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:46.410
The extremely polite "terrible villains" 
are gone, Princess.

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:49.590
Hey, that thing they said...

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:50.250
Yes?

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:53.250
Are you really a traveler?

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:55.250
I am indeed.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.200
What's your name?

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:00.810
I'm known as Mikoto.

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:02.260
"Mikoto," huh?

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:07.960
I'm Saltherine Aldarake.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:11.020
I'm the princess of this land, 
the Kingdom of Aldarake!

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.430
The princess?

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:14.180
Yes!

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:15.980
And now, as a gesture of thanks...

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:20.360
Princess's orders: Follow me!

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:25.320
I thought I heard some commotion!

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:26.990
Your usual game of tag?

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:29.610
You never learn, do you, Highness?

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:32.620
You're of marrying age, you know?

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:35.620
You should really settle down a little.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.010
Yeah, yeah...

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:38.600
Two of my usual, please.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:39.570
Here you are!

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:48.870
This shop's walnut bread is the best!

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:54.600
It does smell nice and fresh!

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:01.480
Delicious!

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:06.220
Okay, next stop!

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:17.000
Your Highness! Everything's fresh today!

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:21.580
The people really seem to like you.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:30.530
In all the countries I've visited, 
I've never seen a princess walking around

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:32.640
without an escort.

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:41.270
I wouldn't know anything 
about any other countries.

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:48.290
What is it?

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.660
Could I take both?

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.050
Of course!

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:55.000
Octopus?

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:04.800
Princess? What's wrong?

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:06.800
Next spot! Hurry!

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:14.560
Wow!

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:18.940
First the bread, now all this?

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:21.970
Thank you so much, Princess.

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:23.820
Think nothing of it.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:27.690
You can pay me back 
by telling me about your journey.

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:28.800
My journey?

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:31.820
Yeah. I want to go on a journey.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:37.080
I want to leave this boring backwater kingdom
and see the outside world.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:39.110
"Boring"?

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:41.080
Yes, boring!

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.960
This place is a total nowhere!

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:45.130
I want to see the outside world!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.460
I want to go on a journey!

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:48.920
This country isn't a "nowhere."

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:51.340
It's a good kingdom.

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:53.970
A good kingdom?

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:56.860
It's peaceful, for one thing.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:58.270
I suppose.

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:00.360
You have an abundance of food,

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:02.980
and the buildings are beautiful.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:04.890
And most of all,

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:07.480
the people are kind.

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:09.970
I know, but still...

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.570
I still hate it.

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:29.050
I hate the thought 
of beginning and ending my life here,

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.280
with nothing in between.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:34.870
It's getting late.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:37.510
Stay in the castle tonight.

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:40.300
You can tell me about
 your journey tomorrow.

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:43.220
See you then, Mikoto.

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:43.970
Sure.

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:46.020
Good night.

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:48.330
Good night.

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:49.500
See you tomorrow.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.340
Good morning.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:09.870
Morning!

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:13.220
Good morning, Your Highness!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.840
Hey, good morning!

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:22.090
Mikoto! You awake?

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:23.770
Princess?

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:28.190
Good morning!

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:29.870
Oh, sorry.

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:31.390
Were you just getting dressed?

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:37.070
You're pretty darn flat, Mikoto!

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.450
Well, I am a man.

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:42.190
But you're skinnier than me, too.

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:43.580
And your complexion is better.

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:45.720
But all that aside—

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:49.900
A man?!

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:51.460
Yes...

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:53.220
But you're skinnier than me!

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:54.970
You're prettier than me!

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.800
Explain yourself!

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:57.390
Princess!

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:07.290
Are you all right, Princess?

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:14.610
W-Well...

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:17.700
All questions of gender aside...

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:20.990
You <i>are</i> still a traveler, aren't you?

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:26.000
Tell me about your journey!

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:28.920
You look way scrawnier than me,

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.750
but you're still traveling solo, right?

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:34.760
Which means those monsters outside 
can't be such a big deal!

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:37.010
How about taking me with you?

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:45.520
My journey is many times more dangerous 
than a normal journey.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.170
You might die.

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:49.670
I might have to abandon you.

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:53.150
Despite all that,

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:56.030
do you still wish to join me?

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:58.030
Hey...

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:02.040
How'd this get all serious?

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.410
"You might die"? It's a little dramatic.

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:08.410
I'm joking. Never mind.

00:10:18.190 --> 00:10:20.800
Now, how can I help you?

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:25.810
I don't recall inviting you here.

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:32.750
I've come to take your kingdom!

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:35.070
But first, I wanted to pay my respects.

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.370
Those horns...

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:39.850
Are you an ogre?!

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:43.080
How terribly observant of you!

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:45.890
I've already consumed your nearest neighbor.

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:49.460
Now it's your turn!

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:55.710
So the rumor that the neighboring land 
fell to monsters is true.

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:58.680
Oh, what a great fool you are.

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:02.090
After I came here to make an honest trade!

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:04.250
A trade?

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:05.520
Yes.

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:09.840
In exchange for <i>not</i> slaughtering 
everyone in your kingdom,

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:14.310
I will accept a sacrifice 
of thirty people per month.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:16.610
Is that acceptable?

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:18.460
Better than full-scale destruction, I'm sure.

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:19.490
Wait, you!

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:22.340
You think you can threaten us and live?!

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.900
That one doesn't count 
toward your total, of course.

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:38.130
Thirty a month! Don't forget.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:47.420
Let's see...

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:52.130
When we walk side-by-side like this, 
it might look like we're courting.

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.020
What?!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:57.230
Oh? I'm sure we just look 
like a princess and her maid.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:58.870
M-Maid?

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:01.030
Or sisters, maybe!

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:03.800
<i>Wh-What...</i>

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:06.780
<i>What is </i>he<i> doing here?!</i>

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:09.020
<i>This is extremely dangerous.</i>

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:10.970
<i>I'll have to call off the plan.</i>

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:20.440
<i>Found you...</i>

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:25.940
Look at all that commotion!

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:27.560
I wonder what happened.

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.920
Hey, Mikoto, want to go see—

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:35.370
Mikoto?

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:38.600
We must fight, Majesty!

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:40.510
You saw what he's capable of!

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:42.560
You think we can beat him ourselves?

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.570
But offering sacrifices...

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:50.430
Hey, what are you all doing here?

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:51.560
Princess...

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:53.180
Your Highness...

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:56.210
Saltherine...

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:09.600
You're always telling me 
that you want to go on a journey.

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:10.950
Yes...

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:21.820
You have my permission.

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.710
You may go wherever you wish.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:28.110
But why now? 
You've always declined before.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:29.860
What's that?

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:31.480
What?

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:33.770
M-Monsters...

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:35.000
And so many of them!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.490
Father!

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:38.430
All hands, to the gates!

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:39.220
Sir!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:42.630
We must not let there be a panic!

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:45.080
Hang on! What's going on here?

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:46.130
Your Highness...

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:47.740
What's going on?

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:56.360
They're monsters.

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:57.640
Ogres!

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.920
<i>Monsters from the outside world?</i>

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:06.820
<i>What's happening? 
My body feels... hot...</i>

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:10.030
<i>I want to see them up close!</i>

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:10.850
Your Highness!

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:12.550
<i>I want to see them! But...</i>

00:14:12.550 --> 00:14:14.540
<i>What will I do when I get close?</i>

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:15.680
<i>What will happen?</i>

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:22.920
Yaki. Thanks for passing on the message.

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:26.300
So? When can we expect the sacrifices—

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:27.750
What's wrong?

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.080
I'm calling it off.

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:33.960
Moki, you should flee at once.

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:34.810
Eh?

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:41.060
Do you recall that I mentioned I came here
 because my own country was destroyed?

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.190
Yes.

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:46.300
The human who destroyed 
my country is here now!

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:48.660
You can't defeat him. Flee!

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:52.380
The human in question... 
Would that be him?

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:06.560
He looks nice and fearless.

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:08.580
I think I'll enjoy wringing his neck!

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:09.890
Don't be absurd!

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:10.700
Run away, now!

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:12.090
Don't <i>you</i> be absurd!

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:15.600
I'll never run!

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:21.100
Mikoto!

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:28.110
Princess?

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:31.230
Sorry, I'm too busy to talk right now.

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:34.120
Stupid!

00:15:34.650 --> 00:15:36.620
You have to run! Right now!

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:39.370
I am Moki.

00:15:40.010 --> 00:15:42.870
I'm known as Mikoto.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:47.650
Is it true that you're behind the destruction 
of a country to the east?

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:49.030
Yes.

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:52.380
Interesting!

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.160
<i>Once upon a time, in a far away land,</i>

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:22.160
<i>lived an old man and an old lady.</i>

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:26.620
<i>The old man went to the mountains 
to gather firewood.</i>

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:29.420
<i>The old woman went to the river 
to do the washing.</i>

00:16:32.390 --> 00:16:33.510
<i>You know the story.</i>

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:36.510
<i>At last, he'd defeated the ogres,</i>

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:39.510
<i>but upon hearing 
there were ogres in other lands,</i>

00:16:40.110 --> 00:16:42.300
<i>Peach Boy set out to cross the great sea...</i>

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:47.800
<i>The feats he performed deserve admiration.</i>

00:16:49.100 --> 00:16:51.310
<i>The salvation he wrought 
deserves celebration.</i>

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:55.420
<i>The only objection to be found...</i>

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.590
<i>was in how much he enjoyed it.</i>

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:07.170
You're the last one standing.

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:11.170
Just... Just who are you?

00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:14.170
Kibitsu Mikoto.

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:18.580
An insignificant traveler who came from afar

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:22.060
hunting you.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:29.840
I've finished them, Princess.

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:35.800
<i>Mikoto saved our kingdom. 
He's a hero.</i>

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:42.140
<i>But is a hero slaying villains 
supposed to look this terrifying?</i>

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:47.460
<i>A dog?</i>

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:50.760
Did you bring my things?

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:52.460
I need to wipe off this blood.

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:54.960
Okay.

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.140
Let's keep going, then.

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:05.210
Goodbye, Saltherine.

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.850
<i>W-Wait a minute...</i>

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:11.420
<i>He's leaving now? Already?!</i>

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:15.260
<i>You have to tell me more... 
about ogres, about you...</i>

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:17.070
<i>Is this the purpose of your journey?</i>

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:18.900
<i>A journey...</i>

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:20.240
<i>Take me with you!</i>

00:18:23.390 --> 00:18:24.480
<i>What in the world...</i>

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:29.250
<i>The dead ogres...</i>

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:31.750
<i>They're disgusting.</i>

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:34.250
<i>Nauseating...</i>

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:43.480
If you'd managed to follow me regardless,

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:46.540
I'd have given you a dumpling.

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:51.940
Wait, Mikoto!

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:54.640
Wait!

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:05.640
Just a dream?

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:10.730
<i>If I'd stopped him, gone with him...</i>

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:16.220
<i>Then what, I wonder?</i>

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:23.710
<i>It's been a month since then.</i>

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:26.930
<i>Day after day of mundane life.</i>

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:29.400
<i>Everything's been just as usual.</i>

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:34.870
<i>And eventually, I had a thought...</i>

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:39.940
<i>About Mikoto.</i>

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:43.480
<i>And...</i>

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:47.680
Father.

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:53.070
I...

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:55.590
I'm going on a journey!

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:57.740
This again?

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:00.220
The danger has passed.

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.430
You should—

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:02.490
I've made up my mind.

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:08.600
I'm abandoning my title, 
abandoning my home, and now...

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:12.600
I'm abandoning the femininity 
that might hinder me from traveling!

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:18.480
You've gained so much strength 
in such a short time.

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:20.610
What in the world happened?

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:25.640
After learning the extent of my ignorance, 
I've spent this past month thinking.

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:29.080
The dangers and monsters 
of the outside world...

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:30.620
All of that "unknown"...

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:35.600
If nothing changes, that unknown... 
will eventually consume me.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.100
So you're going on a journey?

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.590
And what will you do on the outside?

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:44.980
I'll go around, see the world,

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:47.140
and think about it then.

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:49.140
You won't stop me?

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:51.640
Of course I won't.

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:52.780
Thanks.

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:55.220
Goodbye, then.

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.270
Have a fine time out.

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:02.970
And take care.

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:13.340
See you later!

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:25.170
<i>Now...</i>

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:28.660
<i>My journey has begun!</i>

00:23:03.350 --> 00:23:07.150
At least, those were the hopes 
I held as I set out, but...

00:23:07.800 --> 00:23:09.650
It's too darn peaceful out here!

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:11.960
The ogres are based in the south.

00:23:12.680 --> 00:23:15.660
I'm heading south.

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:21.670
I heard there were lots of dangerous monsters 
on the outside besides ogres, but...

00:23:24.610 --> 00:23:26.320
It's a total letdown!

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:31.560
I walk and I walk, 
but it's the same old, same old.

00:23:37.900 --> 00:23:39.060
Huh?

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:43.120
Or... maybe not.

00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:50.250
Frau and the Vampire

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:49.210
Next time: "Frau and the Vampire."
